.TH COAL\-LSP 1 "October 2026" "coal" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
coal\-lsp \- language server for COAL configuration directories
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B coal\-lsp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B coal\-lsp
is a Language Server Protocol server for
.BR coal (1)
configuration directories.
An editor starts it and talks to it over standard input and standard
output; it is not meant to be run by hand.
.PP
The server looks through the editor's workspace folders for COAL
projects.
A folder is a project when it holds a
.I _structure.yaml
file, a
.I _schema/
folder, or an empty marker file named
.IR .coal .
Folders whose name starts with
.B _
or
.BR . ,
and folders named
.I node_modules
or
.IR target ,
are not searched.
A file belongs to the nearest project above it.
.PP
Each project is validated exactly as
.B coal \-\-validate
run in that folder would validate it, using the same code, so the editor
and a command\-line build agree about what is wrong.
Findings are published as diagnostics on the line where the mistake is
written, which is often not the file being edited.
.PP
The server also offers hover information and completion: names in scope
inside
.B {{ ... }}
templates, definitions after
.B $include:
and
.BR $include_optional: ,
keys for
.B $keys
lists, and the values a schema allows.
.SH OPTIONS
.B coal\-lsp
takes no options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR coal (1)
.PP
.UR https://microsoft.github.io/language\-server\-protocol/
Language Server Protocol
.UE
